# VHS recording for the vertical Bar gallery
Output examples/vhs/generated/bar-vertical.gif

Set Theme "Aardvark Blue"
Set Width 965
Set Height 900
Set Padding 30
Set Framerate 25

Hide
Type "target/release/examples/readme bar-vertical"
Enter
Wait+Screen /Braille/
Show
Sleep 1s
Screenshot target/vhs/bar-vertical.png
Sleep 2s
